    null[3] + tableAngle + fudgeAngle - armAngle
  - local.vws modified to allow save into /usr/astro
  - TELESCOP and OBSERVAT are now updated from the tcs:name
  - startup.vws: slalib and timelib are now in /gemini
  - in startup_MINIMAL.vws -> Minimal startup pwfs2
  - in writeZernikes.c ttfZero() remove limits for cass rot angle
  - ospLib.c include last cfitsio version V0-3: FITSIO_READONLY
  - defaults parameters for detSigInit and gains

