    remove cadFanout.sch and sym, cadSequence.sch and sym, link2Dir.sch and 
    sym and link2DirWfs.sch and sym and sequenceCad.sch and sym
  - testResults now instead of dc:testResults
  - Major modification: Include aoP2Lib and remove ospLib
  - Major modification: Create a DHS task
