  - replace detSigMode by several detSigModexxx cad
  - add detType, detId, dataLabel, intTime, nexpRQ,
    nexp, nframes, bunit, exposedRQ, exposed, utstart,
    utend, elapsed sir records : SAD database done
  - IF with TCS done
  - add detDhsDisplay + detSigModeFgCoadd rename fast guide by global guide...

V1-1 24 July 2000 CB:
