    detSigModeFgFocus, detSigModeFgCoadd, detSigModeSeq

V1-4 10 November 2000 CB:
-------------------------
  - add guide when computing the threshold (when using the with spots method)
  - replace aoRmsNoiseDarkCompute aoRmsNoiseImageCompute
  - add update scale when computing average flux threshold
  - add aoSaveCbIm and aoSaveCbCtrl sir records 
  - add possibility to change butterworth filter parameters when probe arm 
    guiding
  - dhsQlRate now is set automatically according the exposure time detControl.c
  - new files in par: zeroFullP2Dark.fits and zeroBinP2Dark.fits 
  - in par: defFullP2Dark.fits and defBinP2Dark.fits contain now real dark 
    for 10ms and 5 ms.
